  "description": "<p data-end=\"477\" data-start=\"60\">&bull; Brand Introduction:</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"477\" data-start=\"60\">Kidulite is a children&rsquo;s educational toy brand dedicated to making learning fun, engaging, and developmentally enriching. Our carefully curated toys encourage creativity, problem-solving, and early skill-building, all while ensuring safety and durability. Whether it&rsquo;s STEM-based games, interactive puzzles, or imaginative playsets, Kidulite is here to spark curiosity and lifelong learning.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"905\" data-start=\"479\">&bull; Product Description:</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"905\" data-start=\"479\">Kidulite offers a wide range of developmental and educational toys designed to support children's cognitive, motor, and social skills. Our products cater to different age groups, from toddlers to early learners, helping them explore numbers, colors, shapes, and problem-solving in a hands-on way. Popular items include stacking games, balance toys, interactive play mats, and sensory learning tools.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"938\" data-start=\"907\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1348\" data-start=\"939\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1014\" data-start=\"939\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1014\" data-start=\"941\">Educational &amp; engaging &ndash; Toys designed to promote learning through play</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1089\" data-start=\"1015\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1089\" data-start=\"1017\">Safe &amp; high-quality materials &ndash; Non-toxic, child-friendly, and durable</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1173\" data-start=\"1090\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1173\" data-start=\"1092\">Scientifically backed play &ndash; Encourages brain development and fine motor skills</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1259\" data-start=\"1174\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1259\" data-start=\"1176\">Affordable &amp; value-packed &ndash; High-quality learning tools at parent-friendly prices</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1348\" data-start=\"1260\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1348\" data-start=\"1262\">Perfect for all learning styles &ndash; Whether it's hands-on, visual, or interactive play</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-end=\"1368\" data-start=\"1350\">&bull; Payment Terms:</p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1562\" data-start=\"1369\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1461\" data-start=\"1369\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1461\" data-start=\"1371\">Secure payment options: Credit/Debit Cards, PayPal, Klarna (if applicable), and Shop Pay</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1525\" data-start=\"1462\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1525\" data-start=\"1464\">Flexible installment options available for larger purchases</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1562\" data-start=\"1526\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1562\" data-start=\"1528\">Fast and secure checkout process</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-end=\"1586\" data-start=\"1564\">&bull; Other Information:</p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1895\" data-start=\"1587\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1663\" data-start=\"1587\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1663\" data-start=\"1589\">Worldwide Shipping</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1735\" data-start=\"1664\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1735\" data-start=\"1666\">Customer Support: Dedicated support team for inquiries &amp; assistance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1805\" data-start=\"1736\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1805\" data-start=\"1738\">Special Offers: Discounts, bundle deals &amp; limited-time promotions</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1895\" data-start=\"1806\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1895\" data-start=\"1808\">Social Media: Follow us on Instagram, TikTok &amp; Facebook for updates &amp; exclusive deals</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>",
